{"step_index":8517,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-07-06T22:04:40Z","thinking":"**Implementing Modal Updates**\n\nI'm currently working on incorporating the modal updates. The plan is to insert the necessary HTML for the notes and checklist manager directly into the code, specifically replacing line 2602 with the designated modal structure. This insertion is the next step to progress on the task.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"replace_file_content","args":{"AllowMultiple":false,"Description":"Add notes-manager-modal and settings-subscreen-modal to the HTML.","EndLine":2603,"Instruction":"Add notes manager and settings subscreen modal definitions.","ReplacementContent":"  </div>\n\n  <!-- ============================================== -->\n  <!-- MODAL: NOTES & CHECKLISTS MANAGER -->\n  <!-- ============================================== -->\n  <div id=\"notes-manager-modal\" class=\"modal-overlay\" style=\"z-index: 10009;\">\n    <div class=\"modal-content\" style=\"max-height: 85vh; display: flex; flex-direction: column; max-width: 480px;\">\n      <div class=\"modal-header\">\n        <div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\">\n          <span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📝</span>\n          <h3 class=\"modal-title\" data-i18n=\"notes_manager_title\">Σημειώσεις & Λίστες</h3>\n          <span id=\"notes-manager-count-badge\" class=\"badge\" style=\"background: var(--accent); color: white; font-size: 11px; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 10px; font-weight: 700; display: none;\">0</span>\n        </div>\n        <span class=\"modal-close\" data-close-modal=\"notes-manager-modal\" style=\"cursor: pointer; font-size: 24px; color: var(--text-secondary); font-weight: 300; line-height: 1;\">&times;</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"modal-body\" style=\"padding: 16px; flex: 1; overflow-y: auto; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px;\">\n        <!-- Notes Search bar -->\n        <div class=\"search-input-wrapper-modern\" style=\"background: rgba(0,0,0,0.15); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 10px; padding: 10px 12px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; box-sizing: border-box; width: 100%;\">\n          <i class=\"fa-solid fa-magnifying-glass\" style=\"color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 12.5px;\"></i>\n          <input type=\"text\" id=\"notes-manager-search-input\" placeholder=\"Αναζήτηση σημειώσεων...\" style=\"background: transparent; border: none; outline: none; color: var(--text-primary); font-size: 13px; flex: 1; padding: 0;\">\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Notes list container -->\n        <div id=\"notes-manager-list\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; min-height: 100px; padding-right: 2px;\">\n          <!-- Dynamically populated -->\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"padding: 16px; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); background: rgba(0,0,0,0.05); display: flex; justify-content: flex-end; box-sizing: border-box;\">\n        <button id=\"notes-manager-add-btn\" class=\"btn btn-primary\" style=\"padding: 10px 20px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; border-radius: 10px; cursor: pointer;\">\n          <i class=\"fa-solid fa-plus\"></i> <span data-i18n=\"new_note_btn\">Νέα Σημείωση</span>\n        </button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- ============================================== -->\n  <!-- MODAL: DYNAMIC SETTINGS SUBSCREEN (ROUTER) -->\n  <!-- ============================================== -->\n  <div id=\"settings-subscreen-modal\" class=\"modal-overlay\" style=\"z-index: 10010;\">\n    <div class=\"modal-content\" style=\"max-height: 85vh; display: flex; flex-direction: column; max-width: 480px;\">\n      <div class=\"modal-header\">\n        <div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\">\n          <span class=\"icon-btn\" data-close-modal=\"settings-subscreen-modal\" style=\"cursor: pointer; font-size: 16px; color: var(--text-primary); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin-right: 4px;\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-arrow-left\"></i></span>\n          <h3 class=\"modal-title\" id=\"settings-subscreen-title\">Ρυθμίσεις</h3>\n        </div>\n        <span class=\"modal-close\" data-close-modal=\"settings-subscreen-modal\" style=\"cursor: pointer; font-size: 24px; color: var(--text-secondary); font-weight: 300; line-height: 1;\">&times;</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"modal-body\" id=\"settings-subscreen-body\" style=\"padding: 16px; flex: 1; overflow-y: auto; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px;\">\n        \n        <!-- SECTION: Preferences -->\n        <div id=\"subscreen-preferences\" class=\"subscreen-section\" style=\"display: none;\">\n          <div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px;\">\n            <div class=\"settings-list-item\" id=\"preferences-lang-row\" style=\"cursor: pointer;\">\n              <span class=\"settings-item-label\" data-i18n=\"item_language\">Γλώσσα</span>\n              <span class=\"settings-item-value\" id=\"lang-setting-val\">Ελληνικά</span>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"settings-list-item\">\n              <span class=\"settings-item-label\" data-i18n=\"item_theme\">Θέμα Εμφάνισης</span>\n              <select id=\"settings-theme\" class=\"settings-select\">\n                <option value=\"dark\">Premium Dark</option>\n                <option value=\"oled\">OLED Black</option>\n                <option value=\"light\">Classic Light</option>\n                <option value=\"emerald\">Emerald Forest</option>\n                <option value=\"ocean\">Ocean Breeze</option>\n                <option value=\"pink\">Blossom Pink</option>\n              </select>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"settings-list-item\">\n              <span class=\"settings-item-label\" data-i18n=\"item_currency\">Κύριο Νόμισμα</span>\n              <select id=\"settings-currency\" class=\"settings-select\">\n                <option value=\"EUR\">EUR (€)</option>\n                <option value=\"USD\">USD ($)</option>\n                <option value=\"GBP\">GBP (£)</option>\n                <option value=\"JPY\">JPY (¥)</option>\n              </select>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"settings-list-item\">\n              <span class=\"settings-item-label\" data-i18n=\"item_month_start\">Έναρξη Μήνα</span>\n              <select id=\"settings-month-start\" class=\"settings-select\">\n                <option value=\"1\">1</option>\n                <option value=\"2\">2</option>\n                <option value=\"3\">3</option>\n                <option value=\"4\">4</option>\n                <option value=\"5\">5</option>\n                <option value=\"6\">6</option>\n                <option value=\"7\">7</option>\n                <option value=\"8\">8</option>\n                <option value=\"9\">9</option>\n                <option value=\"10\">10</option>\n                <option value=\"11\">11</option>\n                <option value=\"12\">12</option>\n                <option value=\"13\">13</option>\n                <option value=\"14\">14</option>\n                <option value=\"15\">15</option>\n                <option value=\"16\">16</option>\n                <option value=\"17\">17</option>\n                <option value=\"18\">18</option>\n                <option value=\"19\">19</option>\n                <option value=\"20\">20</option>\n                <option value=\"21\">21</option>\n                <option value=\"22\">22</option>\n                <option value=\"23\">23</option>\n                <option value=\"24\">24</option>\n                <option value=\"25\">25</option>\n                <option value=\"26\">26</option>\n                <option value=\"27\">27</option>\n                <option value=\"28\">28</option>\n              </select>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"settings-list-item\">\n              <span class=\"settings-item-label\" data-i18n=\"item_week_start\">Έναρξη Εβδομάδας</span>\n              <select id=\"settings-week-start\" class=\"settings-select\">\n                <option value=\"1\" data-i18n=\"val_week_start\">Δευτέρα</option>\n                <option value=\"0\" data-i18n=\"val_week_start_sun\">Κυριακή</option>\n                <option value=\"6\" data-i18n=\"val_week_start_sat\">Σάββατο</option>\n              </select>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"settings-list-item\">\n              <span class=\"settings-item-label\" data-i18n=\"item_app_lock\">Κλείδωμα Εφαρμογής (PIN)</span>\n              <label class=\"switch\">\n                <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"settings-app-lock\">\n                <span class=\"slider round\"></span>\n              </label>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"settings-list-item\">\n              <span class=\"settings-item-label\" data-i18n=\"item_autocomplete\">Έξυπνος Τίτλος (Autocomplete)</span>\n              <label class=\"switch\">\n                <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"settings-autocomplete\">\n                <span class=\"slider round\"></span>\n              </label>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"settings-list-item\">\n              <span class=\"settings-item-label\" data-i18n=\"item_note_shortcut\">Κουμπί Σημειώσεων δίπλα στο \"+\"</span>\n              <label class=\"switch\">\n                <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"settings-note-shortcut\">\n                <span class=\"slider round\"></span>\n              </label>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- SECTION: Sync & Data -->\n        <div id=\"subscreen-sync\" class=\"subscreen-section\" style=\"display: none;\">\n          <div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px;\">\n            <div class=\"settings-list-item\" id=\"sync-supabase-row\" style=\"cursor: pointer;\">\n              <div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; flex: 1;\">\n                <span class=\"settings-item-label\" data-i18n=\"item_sync_status\">Κατάσταση Συγχρονισμού</span>\n                <span class=\"settings-item-value\" id=\"val_sync_status\" style=\"font-size: 11px; margin-top: 2px;\">Τοπική Αποθήκευση</span>\n              </div>\n              <i class=\"fa-solid fa-chevron-right\" style=\"color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 12px;\"></i>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"settings-list-item\" id=\"sync-now-row\" style=\"cursor: pointer;\">\n              <span class=\"settings-item-label\" style=\"color: var(--accent); font-weight: 600;\" data-i18n=\"sync_now_btn\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-arrows-rotate\" style=\"margin-right: 8px;\"></i> Συγχρονισμός Τώρα</span>\n              <span class=\"settings-item-value\" id=\"val_last_sync_time\" style=\"font-size: 11px; color: var(--text-muted);\"></span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"settings-list-item\" id=\"sync-excel-import-row\" style=\"cursor: pointer;\">\n              <span class=\"settings-item-label\" data-i18n=\"card_import_excel\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-file-import\" style=\"margin-right: 8px; color: var(--text-muted);\"></i> Εισαγωγή Excel</span>\n              <i class=\"fa-solid fa-chevron-right\" style=\"color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 12px;\"></i>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"settings-list-item\" id=\"sync-excel-export-row\" style=\"cursor: pointer;\">\n              <span class=\"settings-item-label\" data-i18n=\"card_export_excel\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-file-export\" style=\"margin-right: 8px; color: var(--text-muted);\"></i> Εξαγωγή Excel</span>\n              <i class=\"fa-solid fa-chevron-right\" style=\"color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 12px;\"></i>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- SECTION: Family Management -->\n        <div id=\"subscreen-family\" class=\"subscreen-section\" style=\"display: none;\">\n          <div id=\"partner-linking-container-modal\">\n            <div style=\"padding: 12px; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.1); border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid var(--border);\">\n              <div class=\"partner-status\" data-i18n=\"label_loading\">Φόρτωση στοιχείων...</div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- SECTION: Feedback -->\n        <div id=\"subscreen-feedback\" class=\"subscreen-section\" style=\"display: none;\">\n          <div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px;\">\n            <div class=\"feedback-rating-container\">\n              <div class=\"feedback-subtitle\" data-i18n=\"feedback_rating_title\">Πώς θα βαθμολογούσατε την εφαρμογή;</div>\n              <div class=\"emoji-rating-group\">\n                <button type=\"button\" class=\"emoji-rate-btn\" data-rate=\"1\" title=\"Angry\">😡</button>\n                <button type=\"button\" class=\"emoji-rate-btn\" data-rate=\"2\" title=\"Disappointed\">😕</button>\n                <button type=\"button\" class=\"emoji-rate-btn\" data-rate=\"3\" title=\"Neutral\">😐</button>\n                <button type=\"button\" class=\"emoji-rate-btn\" data-rate=\"4\" title=\"Happy\">🙂</button>\n                <button type=\"button\" class=\"emoji-rate-btn\" data-rate=\"5\" title=\"Love it\">😍</button>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"feedback-form-group\">\n              <div class=\"feedback-subtitle\" data-i18n=\"feedback_type_label\">Τύπος Σχολίου</div>\n              <div class=\"feedback-chips\">\n                <button type=\"button\" class=\"feedback-chip active\" data-type=\"suggestion\" data-i18n=\"feedback_type_feature\">Νέα Λειτουργία</button>\n                <button type=\"button\" class=\"feedback-chip\" data-type=\"bug\" data-i18n=\"feedback_type_bug\">Σφάλμα (Bug)</button>\n                <button type=\"button\" class=\"feedback-chip\" data-type=\"other\" data-i18n=\"feedback_type_other\">Άλλο</button>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"feedback-form-group\">\n              <textarea id=\"feedback-comment\" class=\"feedback-textarea\" placeholder=\"Γράψτε τα σχόλιά σας εδώ...\" data-i18n-placeholder=\"feedback_comment_placeholder\"></textarea>\n            </div>\n            \n            <button type=\"button\" id=\"feedback-submit-btn\" class=\"feedback-btn\">\n              <span id=\"feedback-btn-text\" data-i18n=\"feedback_submit_btn\">Αποστολή Σχολίων</span>\n              <div id=\"feedback-btn-spinner\" class=\"spinner\" style=\"display: none;\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-circle-notch fa-spin\"></i></div>\n            </button>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- SECTION: Legal & Account -->\n        <div id=\"subscreen-legal\" class=\"subscreen-section\" style=\"display: none;\">\n          <div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px;\">\n            <div class=\"settings-list-item\" id=\"legal-force-update-row\" style=\"cursor: pointer;\">\n              <span class=\"settings-item-label\" style=\"color: var(--blue-positive); font-weight: 600;\" data-i18n=\"force_update\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-arrows-rotate\" style=\"margin-right: 8px;\"></i> Αναγκαστική Ενημέρωση (Καθαρισμός Cache)</span>\n              <i class=\"fa-solid fa-chevron-right\" style=\"color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 12px;\"></i>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"settings-list-item\" id=\"legal-privacy-row\" style=\"cursor: pointer;\">\n              <span class=\"settings-item-label\" data-i18n=\"item_privacy\">Πολιτική Απορρήτου</span>\n              <span class=\"settings-item-value\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-arrow-up-right-from-square\" style=\"font-size:12px;\"></i></span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"settings-list-item\" id=\"legal-logout-row\" style=\"cursor: pointer;\">\n              <span class=\"settings-item-label\" style=\"color: var(--red-negative); font-weight: 600;\" data-i18n=\"item_logout\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-right-from-bracket\" style=\"margin-right: 8px;\"></i> Αποσύνδεση Λογαριασμού</span>\n              <i class=\"fa-solid fa-chevron-right\" style=\"color: var(--red-negative); font-size: 12px;\"></i>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"settings-list-item\">\n              <span class=\"settings-item-label\" id=\"legal-version-label\" style=\"color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 12px;\" data-i18n=\"app_version\">Έκδοση 1.0.0</span>\n              <span class=\"settings-item-value\" style=\"font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-muted);\">Budget Assistant</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  </div>","StartLine":2602,"TargetContent":"  </div>","TargetFile":"c:\\Users\\mario\\Desktop\\money-manager\\index.html","toolAction":"Adding settings and notes modals to index.html","toolSummary":"Add modals to HTML"}}]}